      "note": "A Ta có y' = 7x 6 ."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "content": "Câu 2: Tính đạo hàm của hàm số \\(y = \\frac{{{x^2} + 2x - 3}}{{x + 2}}\\) .",
      "options": [
        "A. \\(y' = \\frac{{{x^2} + 8x + 1}}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\) .",
        "B. \\(y' = \\frac{{{x^2} + 4x + 7}}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\) .",
        "C. \\(y' = 1 + \\frac{3}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\) .",
        "D. \\(y' = \\frac{{{x^2} + 4x + 5}}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\) ."
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "note": "B Ta có \\(y' = \\frac{{\\left( {2x + 2} \\right)\\left( {x + 2} \\right) - \\left( {{x^2} + 2x - 3} \\right)}}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\)\\( = \\frac{{{x^2} + 4x + 7}}{{{{\\left( {x + 2} \\right)}^2}}}\\) ."
    },
